        "en": "Pet owners frequently praise Niall, Javier, and the clinic nurses for their gentle demeanour and thorough consultations. Reviewers note that the team remains warm, polite, and attentive from the reception desk onwards. Longtime neighbours and first-time visitors alike highlight the staff's dedication and calm bedside manner."
