        "en": "Clients consistently appreciate how comfortable their cats and dogs feel during routine check-ups and vaccine appointments. Several reviewers mention that nervous or timid kittens are handled with patience and empathy. Owners express peace of mind knowing their animals receive gentle attention during every clinic consultation."
      }
