        "en": "Reviewers highlight that veterinary staff explain diagnoses and treatment steps clearly so owners understand their pet's care plan. The reception desk and clinical team are praised for prompt communication and answering owner questions thoroughly. Clients note that advice is given without jargon, making follow-up care straightforward."
